    "description": {
      "value": "Just as a creature is about to attack you, you assault them with jarring illusions, completely surrounding their eyes with blinding flashes of motion and color. When the spell is complete, you gain the Overload Vision reaction; once you use the reaction, the spell ends.\n\nThe triggering creature must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\nCritical Success: The target is unaffected.\nSuccess: The target is dazzled until the end of the current turn.\nFailure: The target is blinded until the end of the current turn.\nCritical Failure: The target is blinded until the end of the current turn and dazzled for 1 minute."
